Keep url-test selections bound to current provider instances and synchronize state.
Source: https://github.com/getmikan/Citrus/pull/61
Commit: c3b0e5bc21993ca954fcef622aeb06d65c9297cb

Retains the Citrus algorithm and its regression tests: include index zero,
rebind replaced instances, widen tolerance arithmetic, and guard selection state.
No additional behavior from upstream PR #2597 or the pending-check retention of
upstream PR #3232 are added. Only a source-reference comment is added to the code.

